      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "<font color=\"#0d47a1\"><b> CMU-MOSEI Multimodal Dataset Overview</b></font>\n",
        "\n",
        "<font color=\"#0d47a1\">The CMU-MOSEI (CMU Multimodal Opinion Sentiment and Emotion Intensity)dataset is one of the largest and most widely used benchmark datasets for multimodal sentiment analysis and emotion recognition.</font>\n",
        "\n",
        "<font color=\"#0d47a1\">• <b>Data Scale:</b> Contains over 23,000 video segments extracted from more than 1,000 distinct YouTube speakers covering a wide variety of topics.</font>\n",
        "\n",
        "<font color=\"#0d47a1\">• <b>Three Modalities:</b></font>\n",
        "\n",
        "<font color=\"#0d47a1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;◦ <b>Text (Language):</b> Transcribed speech and word-level vector representations (e.g., GloVe embeddings).</font>\n",
        "\n",
        "<font color=\"#0d47a1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;◦ <b>Acoustic (Audio):</b> Pitch, tone, energy, and acoustic features (e.g., COVAREP).</font>\n",
        "\n",
        "<font color=\"#0d47a1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;◦ <b>Visual (Video):</b> Facial expression tracking, action units, and facial landmarks (e.g., OpenFace, FACET).</font>\n",
        "\n",
        "<font color=\"#0d47a1\">• <b>Annotations:</b></font>\n",
        "\n",
        "<font color=\"#0d47a1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;◦ <b>Sentiment:</b> Continuously rated on a scale from -3 (extremely negative) to +3 (extremely positive).</font>\n",
        "\n",
        "<font color=\"#0d47a1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;◦ <b>Emotions:</b> Rated across 6 Ekman emotion categories (happiness, sadness, anger, surprise, disgust, fear).</font>\n",
        "\n",
        "<font color=\"#0d47a1\">It is designed to train and evaluate AI models that combine visual, vocal, and textual cues to understand human emotional expressions.</font>"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "SjB2y3OWlOgL"
      }
    },
