        "# GPT-4o-mini Multimodal Description Generation Pipeline\n",
        "\n",
        "This script integrates the **OpenAI API (gpt-4o-mini)** to generate natural, single-sentence English summaries for CMU-MOSEI video samples based on combined text transcripts and multimodal metrics:\n",
        "\n",
        "* **Data Cleaning & Preprocessing:**\n",
        "  * Standardizes feature arrays by replacing NaN and Inf values with 0.\n",
        "  * Filters out filler tokens (e.g., \"sp\") from transcripts and caps text length at 350 characters.\n",
        "\n",
        "* **Multimodal Feature Extraction:**\n",
        "  * Extracts overall sentiment score and active emotion labels (> 0.6 threshold).\n",
        "  * Calculates facial activity level and voice energy level using vector norms.\n",
        "\n",
        "* **Prompt Construction & API Calling:**\n",
        "  * Feeds sentiment scores, active emotions, visual/acoustic energy levels, and transcript context into `gpt-4o-mini`.\n",
        "  * Instructs the model to synthesize emotional state, facial expression, voice tone, and speech topic into a single fluent sentence.\n",
        "\n",
        "* **Batch Output Generation:** Processes and prints generated descriptions for the first 6 video samples with error handling."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "0EqpsMczrx0n"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "import pickle\n",
        "import numpy as np\n",
        "from openai import OpenAI\n",
        "\n",
        "# ========== Please insert your API Key here ==========\n",
        "client = OpenAI(api_key=\"your API Key")\n",
        "# =====================================================\n",
        "\n",
        "# Load data\n",
        "with open(\"/Users/ting-yenwang/Downloads/CMU-MOSEI/multimodal_30samples_with_transcript.pkl\", \"rb\") as f:\n",
        "    data = pickle.load(f)\n",
        "\n",
        "def clean(x):\n",
        "    x = np.array(x, dtype=np.float64)\n",
        "    return np.nan_to_num(x, nan=0.0, posinf=0.0, neginf=0.0)\n",
        "\n",
        "def clean_transcript(text):\n",
        "    words = [w for w in text.split() if w.lower() != \"sp\"]\n",
        "    return \" \".join(words)\n",
        "\n",
        "def generate_with_gpt(sample):\n",
        "    label = clean(sample['label'])[:7]\n",
        "    face_energy = np.linalg.norm(clean(sample['face']))\n",
        "    audio_energy = np.linalg.norm(clean(sample['audio']))\n",
        "    transcript = clean_transcript(sample.get('transcript', ''))[:350]\n",
        "\n",
        "    sentiment = label[0]\n",
        "    emotions = []\n",
        "    names = ['happiness', 'sadness', 'anger', 'surprise', 'disgust', 'fear']\n",
        "    for i, name in enumerate(names):\n",
        "        if label[i+1] > 0.6:\n",
        "            emotions.append(f\"{name} ({label[i+1]:.2f})\")\n",
        "\n",
        "    prompt = f\"\"\"\n",
        "You are an expert at describing a speaker's emotional state and content.\n",
        "\n",
        "Based on the following information, write ONE natural, fluent English sentence that describes:\n",
        "- The speaker's overall emotional state\n",
        "- Facial expression\n",
        "- Tone of voice\n",
        "- What they are talking about\n",
        "\n",
        "Information:\n",
        "- Sentiment score: {sentiment:.2f} (-3 very negative to +3 very positive)\n",
        "- Detected emotions: {', '.join(emotions) if emotions else 'none strong'}\n",
        "- Facial activity level: {face_energy:.1f}\n",
        "- Voice energy level: {audio_energy:.1f}\n",
        "- Transcript: \"{transcript}\"\n",
        "\n",
        "Requirements:\n",
        "- Write only one sentence.\n",
        "- Be natural and concise.\n",
        "- Do not copy the transcript directly.\n",
        "- Combine emotion, face, voice, and topic smoothly.\n",
        "\"\"\"\n",
        "\n",
        "    response = client.chat.completions.create(\n",
        "        model=\"gpt-4o-mini\",\n",
        "        messages=[\n",
        "            {\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": \"You are a helpful assistant that writes natural descriptions of speakers.\"},\n",
        "            {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": prompt}\n",
        "        ],\n",
        "        temperature=0.6,\n",
        "        max_tokens=80\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "    return response.choices[0].message.content.strip()\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"=== Generating descriptions using gpt-4o-mini ===\\n\")\n",
        "for i, sample in enumerate(data[:6]):\n",
        "    try:\n",
        "        desc = generate_with_gpt(sample)\n",
        "        print(f\"[{i+1}] ID: {sample['id']}\")\n",
        "        print(f\"Generated: {desc}\")\n",
        "        print()\n",
        "    except Exception as e:\n",
        "        print(f\"[{i+1}] Error occurred: {e}\")\n",
        "        print()"
      ],
